# The kit is byte-exact: embedded templates are compared against the
# repo files and installed files are hash-checked. Line-ending
# conversion on Windows checkouts (core.autocrlf) would silently
# rewrite those files, so text checks out with LF everywhere except
# Windows batch files, which cmd.exe reads most reliably as CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.safetensors binary
*.7z binary
*.exe binary
